        915
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Note that the future of πάσχω, ‘I suffer’, is πείσομαι – exactly the same as\nthe future of πείθομαι, ‘I trust, obey’. Only the context will tell you whether\nπείσομαι means, ‘I shall suffer’ or ‘I shall trust, obey’.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
